OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fcalm. Spells of light rain and drizzle
OL,7,Fwill be mainly focused on the North
OL,8,FPennines at first then the hills of
OL,9,FCumbria after midnight. Remaining
OL,10,Fmostly dry further south, but with
OL,11,Fsome fog blossoming. A chilly night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FAny fog will slowly lift
OL,14,Fthrough the morning. Some cloud, but
OL,15,Fsome spells of autumn sunshine on
OL,16,Foffer. Cool, calm and dry, with clear
OL,17,Fspells lengthening into the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
