OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSome
OL,6,Ffog and frost on Monday morning, then
OL,7,Fsunny. A cold start again on Tuesday,
OL,8,Fand cloud will gradually thicken ahead
OL,9,Fof afternoon rain. Milder, wetter and
OL,10,Fbreezier on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
